                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic">September 12,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that the Chinese Government consent to the substitution of
                    An-tung for Ta-tung-kou.)</p>
            </div>
